Package: cpt
Type: Package
Title: Change Point Detection for Animal Tracking Data
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Katrina", "Brock", email = "kbrock@ab.mpg.de", role = "aut"),
    person("Rainer", "Hirk", email = "Rainer.Hirk@quintik.at", role = "aut"),
    person("Florian", "Schwendinger", email = "Florian.Schwendinger@quintik.at", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description:
    Implements a permutation-based approach for detecting significant change points in animal movement trajectory data.
    Change points represent locations where movement patterns significantly change,
    which can indicate behavioral transitions or responses to environmental stimuli.
    The package provides functions for both detecting change points in animal tracking data.
